{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of divisors of the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93cf5e9b7bf402aa269c7992eca9ebfcb884710b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 8\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 5\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c19cd33179621b176981d986a4caf7dff2060754.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006=2\\cdot17\\cdot59$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"131\" height=\"13\" />. A divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is therefore in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/535e7d53c11b181507801cef25411d971e3eda89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m\\cdot 17^n\\cdot 59^p$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bf5caecca5a71eb08b6254a2cf8991a60d47ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f1eb668acdbf240f3287a12b70f5b7eb9227d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/0/e90b513f27851665de9989aa5dda101abb0ebb1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>There are 2 choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, 2 choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, and 2 choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f83957fd13162ea6d00f193202a795c4b1157e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot2\\cdot2=\\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"23\" /> divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:cen